    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into a unique experience at the Greenlake Fishing Tournament, where the beauty of nature and the art of fishing come together in perfect harmony. Developed by the talented students of the Federal Institute of Rond\u00f4nia, this game combines fun, learning, and friendly competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f <i>Natural Exploration</i>: Different species of aquatic creatures to catch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <i>Time Management</i>: Test your skills during a full day at Greenlake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Versatile Gameplay</i>: Train hard to challenge your friends with daily, weekly, and monthly scoreboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <i>Educational Atmosphere</i>: Learn about biodiversity and discover various species of fish while having fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to relax, learn, and have fun like never before. Come and join the Greenlake Fish Tournament!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into a unique experience at the Greenlake Fishing Tournament, where the beauty of nature and the art of fishing come together in perfect harmony. Developed by the talented students of the Federal Institute of Rond\u00f4nia, this game combines fun, learning, and friendly competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f <i>Natural Exploration</i>: Different species of aquatic creatures to catch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <i>Time Management</i>: Test your skills during a full day at Greenlake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Versatile Gameplay</i>: Train hard to challenge your friends with daily, weekly, and monthly scoreboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <i>Educational Atmosphere</i>: Learn about biodiversity and discover various species of fish while having fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to relax, learn, and have fun like never before. Come and join the Greenlake Fish Tournament!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the beauty of Greenlake in this educational fishing tournament! Catch diverse creatures, learn about biodiversity, and challenge friends on daily, weekly, and monthly leaderboards. Relaxation and fun guaranteed, proudly developed by the Federal Institute of Rond\u00f4nia!",
